us\":\"NOT_COLLECTED\",\"lnaReason\":null,\"auctions\":[],\"state\":\"Wilayah Persekutuan\",\"city\":\"Kuala Lumpur\",\"country\":\"Malaysia\",\"isVirtualViewingSupported\":false,\"hotDealsId\":2,\"mogp\":false,\"favourite\":false,\"robot\":null,\"propertyVirtualTour\":[],\"virtualTourAvailable\":false,\"viewingAvailableDate\":null,\"viewingAvailabilityChangeReason\":null,\"source\":\"APP\",\"propertyProductTypes\":[{\"id\":335600,\"propertyId\":300199,\"productType\":\"DEPOSIT\",\"active\":true,\"dateCreated\":\"2026-05-16T21:39:01\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-16T21:39:01\"},{\"id\":335599,\"propertyId\":300199,\"productType\":\"INSURANCE\",\"active\":true,\"dateCreated\":\"2026-05-16T21:39:01\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2026-05-16T21:39:01\"}],\"autoPreferredViewingTime\":false,\"preferredViewingTimes\":[],\"propertyGuideId\":null,\"propertyTenantPreference\":{\"malaysian\":\"ALL\",\"foreigner\":\"ALL\",\"petFriendly\":\"NONE\",\"profession\":\"ALL\",\"tenancyDuration\":12,\"isMuslim\":false,\"totalTenantAllowed\":0,\"gender\":\"ALL\",\"country\":[\"ALL\"]},\"propertyVerified\":false,\"priceStatistics\":{\"minPrice\":0,\"maxPrice\":0,\"medianPrice\":0,\"market75Price\":0,\"market90Price\":0},\"propertyRating\":null,\"propertyUtility\":null,\"outOfCoverageArea\":false,\"slug\":\"savvy-riana-dutamas-2-segambut-cdgjemua\",\"aiDescription\":{\"en\":\"This 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom unit at Savvy Riana Dutamas 2 spans 1,203 sqft on Jalan Segambut, offering practical layout suitable for family living. Partially furnished, the unit includes key built-in fixtures with open living and dining areas. The development features 24-hour security, a swimming pool and a children's playground. A kindergarten and SRI College are within a <2km drive, while clinics including Klinik Seri Indah are within a <2km drive. A surau is within a <2km drive for religious needs. Convenience stores such as 7-Eleven and 99 Speedmart are within a 5-10 min walk, and multiple restaurants including Jay Aloki Bhavan and Pit Stop are within a <2km drive. Two covered parking spaces are included.\",\"my\":\"Unit 3 bilik tidur, 2 bilik air di Savvy Riana Dutamas 2 seluas 1,203 kaki persegi di Jalan Segambut, menawarkan susun atur praktikal untuk kehidupan keluarga. Berperabot separa, unit ini merangkumi fixture bina-dalam utama dengan kawasan tamu dan makan terbuka. Pembangunan ini menawarkan keselamatan 24 jam, kolam renang dan taman permainan kanak-kanak. Tadika dan SRI College dalam <2km pandu, klinik termasuk Klinik Seri Indah dalam <2km pandu. Surau dalam <2km pandu untuk keperluan keagamaan. Kedai serbaneka seperti 7-Eleven dan 99 Speedmart dalam 5-10 min jalan, dan pelbagai restoran termasuk Jay Aloki Bhavan dan Pit Stop dalam <2km pandu. Dua tempat letak kereta berbumbung disediakan.\",\"cn\":\"Savvy Riana Dutamas 2的这套3卧室2浴室单位面积1,203平方英尺，位于Jalan Segambut，布局实用，适合家庭居住。半装修单位配有主要嵌入式固定装置，设有开放式客厅和餐厅。开发项目提供24小时保安、游泳池和儿童游乐场。幼儿园和SRI学院在<2公里车程内，Klinik Seri Indah等诊所在<2公里车程内。祈祷室在<2公里车程内。7-Eleven和99 Speedmart等便利店在5-10分钟步行范围内，Jay Aloki Bhavan和Pit Stop等餐厅在<2公里车程内。配备两个有盖停车位。\"},\"isRented\":false,\"marketingStatus\":null,\"marketingStatusLabel\":null,\"tenantStatus\":null,\"chatRequestCount\":1,\"viewingAppointmentCount\":0,\"uniqueViewCount\":null},{\"id\":300139,\"user\":{\"id\":550471,\"name\":\"CHUA CHONG LEE\",\"avatar\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/avatar/GTRUUNXCCLE9SLFP/avatar-medium.jpg\",\"avatarImageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/avatar/GTRUUNXCCLE9SLFP/avatar\",\"phoneNumber\":null,\"userStatsDto\":null,\"isVerifiedLandlord\":null,\"isVerifiedUser\":false},\"ref\":\"LHVLLDKZ\",\"name\":\"Savvy Riana Dutamas 2, Segambut\",\"address\":\"352, Jalan Segambut, Segambut KL\",\"level\":\"1\",\"storeys\":null,\"type\":\"ROOM\",\"furnishType\":\"FULL\",\"roomType\":\"MEDIUM\",\"bathroomType\":\"SHARED\",\"status\":\"ACTIVE\",\"active\":true,\"instantView\":false,\"noDeposit\":true,\"fullyFurnishable\":false,\"negotiable\":false,\"o