r\\r\\n- ⁠50’ 4k Smart TV\\r\\n- ⁠420L Fridge\\r\\n- ⁠20L Microwave\\r\\n- ⁠Kitchen cabinet with hood and hob\\r\\n- ⁠3 Seater Sofa\\r\\n- ⁠4 Seater Dining table set\\r\\n- ⁠Study table and chair\\r\\n- ⁠Build in 4 door wardrobe \\r\\n- ⁠Build in water heater \\r\\n- ⁠Build in AC\\r\\n- ⁠Wall mounted AC\\r\\n- ⁠Queen size Bed and Akemi Obviously Opposite mattress\\r\\n\\r\\nWHY THIS UNIT? \\n​Direct Owner: Deal directly with me for a fast & easy process. ​\\nPrime Location: Steps away from MITEC & MATRADE. ​\\nConvenience: Unit is located right next to the lift—no long walks down the corridor! ​\\nHigh Floor: Quiet, breezy, and exclusive (Level 38). \\n​LOCATION & ACCESSIBILITY: ​5 mins to Publika & Solaris Mont Kiara. ​10 mins to Mont Kiara International School. ​15 mins to KLCC / Bukit Bintang. ​Easy access to DUKE, NKVE, and Jalan Kuching. \\n\\n​AVAILABILITY: ​Ready to move in: 1st March 2026 ​Viewings can be arranged for serious tenants. ​\\nRENTAL: RM 3500 (Negotiable for long-term tenant)\",\"allRaces\":true,\"petFriendly\":false,\"minRentalDuration\":6,\"editorPick\":false,\"furnishes\":[\"microwave\",\"water_heater\",\"hood\",\"dining_table\",\"tv\",\"curtain\",\"bed_frame\",\"kitchen_cabinet\",\"wardrobe\",\"washing_machine\",\"mattress\",\"sofa\",\"fridge\",\"ac\"],\"utilityTypes\":[\"WATER\",\"ELECTRICITY\",\"INTERNET\"],\"facilities\":[\"playground\",\"bbq\",\"elevator\",\"gym\",\"swimming\",\"security24hr\",\"covered_parking\"],\"images\":[{\"id\":1853744,\"propertyId\":297944,\"imageId\":1881331,\"code\":\"PMSEIZTYLALQKTEK\",\"coverPhoto\":true,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/UIACHRKJ/PMSEIZTYLALQKTEK-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/UIACHRKJ/PMSEIZTYLALQKTEK-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Stunning city view from a fully furnished 1-bedroom apartment in Met 1 Residences KL Metropolis.\"},{\"id\":1853745,\"propertyId\":297944,