07:27:10\",\"lastUpdated\":\"2025-04-29T07:27:10\"}],\"autoPreferredViewingTime\":false,\"preferredViewingTimes\":[],\"propertyGuideId\":null,\"propertyTenantPreference\":null,\"propertyVerified\":true,\"priceStatistics\":{\"minPrice\":1700,\"maxPrice\":2000,\"medianPrice\":1800,\"market75Price\":1850,\"market90Price\":2000},\"propertyRating\":2,\"propertyUtility\":null,\"outOfCoverageArea\":false,\"slug\":\"sri-putramas-kuala-lumpur-gawudekw\",\"aiDescription\":null,\"isRented\":true,\"marketingStatus\":null,\"marketingStatusLabel\":null,\"tenantStatus\":null,\"chatRequestCount\":41,\"viewingAppointmentCount\":13,\"uniqueViewCount\":null},{\"id\":288415,\"user\":{\"id\":806136,\"name\":\"shoot kah sein\",\"avatar\":null,\"avatarImageUrl\":null,\"phoneNumber\":null,\"userStatsDto\":null,\"isVerifiedLandlord\":null,\"isVerifiedUser\":false},\"ref\":\"JMWYNSAR\",\"name\":\"Duta Park Residences, Kuala Lumpur\",\"address\":\"Lot 20015, Seksyen 48, Jalan Kolam Air, Off, Jln Kuching, 51200 Kuala Lumpur, Federal Territory of Kuala Lumpur\",\"level\":\"56\",\"storeys\":null,\"type\":\"HIGHRISE\",\"furnishType\":\"PARTIAL\",\"roomType\":null,\"bathroomType\":null,\"status\":\"ACTIVE\",\"active\":true,\"instantView\":false,\"noDeposit\":true,\"fullyFurnishable\":false,\"negotiable\":true,\"owner\":true,\"sqft\":957,\"bedroom\":2,\"bathroom\":2,\"carpark\":2,\"roommate\":null,\"price\":2700,\"postcode\":\"51200\",\"unitNumber\":\"-\",\"latitude\":3.1706746691253733,\"longitude\":101.68638966137273,\"description\":\"Executive High-Floor Living @ Duta Park Residences\\nPartially Furnished Unit | Basement Carpark\\n\\n- Enjoy better breeze, privacy, and an elevated view away from the hustle and bustle of the main roads.\\n- Equipped with an Electronic Smart Lock for premium keyless convenience and peace of mind.\\n- High-quality Premium Blackout Curtains installed throughout to keep the unit cool, private, and elegant.\\n- Parking Convenience: Includes 2 basement carparks. Skip the daily frustration of driving up endless spiral ramps—drive straight into the basement and take the lift straight to your home.\\n- Low-Density Living: Enjoy exclusivity, quieter corridors, and quicker lift access.\\n\\nPremium Kitchen & Home Appliances Included:\\n- Modern Kitchen Hood & Hob\\n- Multi-Functional Kitchen Sink (perfect for home cooks)\\n- Large 280L Refrigerator\\n- Effortless Laundry: 8kg Top-Load Washing Machine & Dedicated Dryer\\n\\nUnmatched Accessibility & Location\\n- Nestled in a strategic transit hub with direct connections to major highways (Jalan Kuching, Jalan Tun Razak, and the DUKE Highway), putting the entire city within easy reach.\\n- Commute: Just a 10-minute drive to the heart of KL City Centre (KLCC).\\n- Public Transport: 3-minute drive / short distance to Putra KTM Station (and nearby LRT connections).\\n- Shopping & Groceries: 3-minute drive to Cold Storage at Sunway Putra Mall for all your premium grocery, dining, and retail needs.\",\"allRaces\":true,\"petFriendly\":false,\"minRentalDuration\":12,\"editorPick\":true,\"furnishes\":[\"washing_machine\",\"curtain\",\"fridge\",\"kitchen_cabinet\",\"ac\",\"hood\",\"water_heater\"],\"utilityTypes\":[\"WATER\",\"ELECTRICITY\"],\"facilities\":[\"playground\",\"security24hr\",\"sauna\",\"gym\",\"covered_parking\",\"swimming\",\"bbq\"],\"images\":[{\"id\":1763041,\"propertyId\":288415,\"imageId\":1789391,\"code\":\"F8YHBDNGD1DAFZN7\",\"coverPhoto\":true,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/JMWYNSAR/F8YHBDNGD1DAFZN7-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/JMWYNSAR/F8YHBDNGD1DAFZN7-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern kitchen with hood & hob in a 2-bedroom unit at Duta Park Residences, Kuala Lumpur.\"},{\"id\":1763037,\"propertyId\":288415,\"imageId\":1789387,\"code\":\"RPPWPNS0M2WVH4IO\",\"coverPhoto\":false,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images