ccess to KLIA, TRX, Bukit Bintang, HKL, etc)\\r\\n * Various petrol stations, clinics, and banks.\\r\\n\\r\\n* Easy access to public transportation and major roads. The property is also within a short driving distance to AEON Big Riverwalk Village and Sentul KTM Station. This makes it ideal for students attending nearby schools or families who need easy access to amenities and transportation.\",\"allRaces\":true,\"petFriendly\":true,\"minRentalDuration\":6,\"editorPick\":true,\"furnishes\":[\"mattress\",\"water_heater\",\"microwave\",\"wardrobe\",\"tv\",\"washing_machine\",\"bed_frame\",\"kitchen_cabinet\",\"dining_table\",\"fridge\",\"sofa\",\"ac\",\"curtain\"],\"utilityTypes\":[],\"facilities\":[\"sauna\",\"bbq\",\"playground\",\"swimming\",\"elevator\",\"dobby\",\"mart\",\"security24hr\",\"restaurant\",\"gym\",\"covered_parking\"],\"images\":[{\"id\":1741313,\"propertyId\":286003,\"imageId\":1767663,\"code\":\"XBUGF7EZ6GFJHGSF\",\"coverPhoto\":true,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/YFMICYED/XBUGF7EZ6GFJHGSF-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/YFMICYED/XBUGF7EZ6GFJHGSF-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern 3-bedroom apartment with city view in Kuala Lumpur\"},{\"id\":1741314,\"propertyId\":286003,\"imageId\":1767664,\"code\":\"RAERYSSVDIJZK6N7\",\"coverPhoto\":false,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/YFMICYED/RAERYSSVDIJZK6N7-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/YFMICYED/RAERYSSVDIJZK6N7-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern 3-bedroom apartment with city view in Kuala Lumpur\"},{\"id\":1741315,\"propertyId\":286003,\"imageId\":1767665,\"code\":\"IZVQECT7YTJRSKI2\",\"coverPhoto\":false,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/YFMICYED/IZVQECT7YTJRSKI2-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.sp