          "content": {
            "size": 9449,
            "compression": 6233,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\"area\":\"Mont Kiara\",\"areaEnglish\":\"Mont Kiara\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"title\":\"18 Houses for Rent in Mont Kiara from RM385 | SPEEDHOME\",\"metaDescription\":\"Zero deposit available. Browse 18 Houses for rent in Mont Kiara. From RM385/month. SPEEDHOME.\",\"whyChooseTitle\":\"Why Mont Kiara Stands Out for Renters\",\"faqTitle\":\"Common Questions About Renting in Mont Kiara\",\"relatedBuildingsTitle\":\"Popular Developments in Mont Kiara\",\"nearbyAreasTitle\":\"Adjacent Neighbourhoods Worth Considering\",\"reasonChooseAreaAsNextHome\":\"Mont Kiara sits in the western corridor of Kuala Lumpur, directly served by the MRT Putrajaya Line with stations linking into the city centre and the government hub at Putrajaya. The neighbourhood draws a high concentration of expatriates and professionals partly because Publika — a converted warehouse creative complex — and Solaris Mont Kiara cluster restaurants, co-working spaces, and weekend markets within walking distance of most apartment towers. 1 Mont Kiara Mall and Plaza Mont Kiara cover daily errands, while international schools within a short drive make the area workable for families who need those options. The mix of serviced residences, condos, and townhouses gives renters flexibility on layout and budget. Commutes by MRT into KLCC typically take 25-35 minutes, making Mont Kiara practical for anyone working in the city centre or the government/business district to the south.\",\"advantageRentingInArea\":\"Renting in Mont Kiara puts daily amenities within walking distance — Publika's food halls and independent retailers, Solaris Mont Kiara's restaurants, and 1 Mont Kiara Mall for groceries and services. The MRT Putrajaya Line gives a direct rail option without relying on road congestion during peak hours. The area is well-established with a strong expat community, international schools nearby, and a wide property inventory ranging from compact studios to multi-bedroom condos. Many landlords offer flexible lease terms, and zero deposit options through SPEEDHOME can reduce the upfront cost of moving in.\",\"hottestNeighbourhood\":[{\"name\":\"Solaris Mont Kiara\",\"title\":\"Solaris Mont Kiara — dining and retail hub\",\"description\":\"The Solaris cluster anchors Mont Kiara's social life with restaurants, cafes, and convenience options — a short walk from most towers.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/Skyline_of_Mont%27_Kiara%2C_Feb_2022.jpg\"},{\"name\":\"Mont Kiara Bayu\",\"title\":\"Mont Kiara Bayu — established residential\",\"description\":\"A quieter residential enclave of mid-rise condos with mature landscaping — popular with families prioritising space over central energy.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/View_of_Mont_Kiara_viewed_from_Mont_Kiara_Bayu_condominium_01.jpg/1024px-View_of_Mont_Kiara_viewed_from_Mont_Kiara_Bayu_condominium_01.jpg\"},{\"name\":\"Publika Area\",\"title\":\"Publika — creative and cultural core\",\"description\":\"Publika's converted warehouse layout hosts art galleries, weekend markets, and a diverse food scene — a defining feature of western Mont Kiara.\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9b/Skyline_of_Mont_Kiara%2C_Kuala_Lumpur.jpg\"}],\"faq\":[{\"question\":\"What types of property are available to rent in Mont Kiara?\",\"answer\":\"Mont Kiara offers a broad selection: serviced residences with full amenities, mid-range and premium condos, townhouses, and shared rooms. Studios and one- to three-bedroom units are the most common rental formats.\"},{\"question\":\"How do I get around Mont Kiara without a car?\",\"answer\":\"The MRT Putrajaya Line runs through Mont Kiara with stations linking directly to KL Sentral, the city centre, and Putrajaya. Within the neighbourhood, most daily destinations — Publika, Solaris, and the malls — are walkable from nearby towers.\"},{\"question\":\"Is Mont Kiara a good area for expats?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Mont Kiara has a well-established expatriate community, international schools within driving distance, and lifestyle amenities (restaurants, gyms, co-working spaces) that cater to international residents. The MRT connection also makes it practical for those working in KLCC or government districts.\"},{\"question\":\"What documents do I need to rent in Mont Kiara through SPEEDHOME?\",\"answer\":\"Malaysian residents need MyKad, the two most recent payslips, and a three-month bank statement. Non-citizens need a passport, a valid work permit or dependent pass, and an employment contract or reference letter. SPEEDHOME handles the approval process digitally and typically responds within one to two business days.\"},{\"question\":\"Is Mont Kiara safe to rent in?\",\"answer\":\"Mont Kiara falls under the Sentul police district and records a low crime rate relative to the wider Kuala Lumpur area. The neighbourhood has active security in most condo developments, well-lit common areas, and regular patrols in the commercial zones.\"},{\"question\":\"Are there international schools near Mont Kiara?\",\"answer\":\"Several international schools operate within a short drive of Mont Kiara, including options along the western corridor. Parents should confirm current enrollment terms and transportation arrangements directly with each school.\"},{\"question\":\"How long does it take to commute from Mont Kiara to KLCC?\",\"answer\":\"By MRT from the Mont Kiara area, the journey to KLCC typically takes 25-35 minutes depending on the specific station and connection. Driving takes a similar duration in non-peak conditions but can extend significantly during morning and evening rush hours.\"}],\"categories\":[{\"type\":\"House\",\"url\":\"/rent/mont-kiara\",\"primaryKeyword\":\"houses for rent in mont kiara\",\"secondaryKeywords\":[\"house to let in mont kiara\",\"property for rent in mont kiara\",\"home for rent in mont kiara\"]},{\"type\":\"Condo\",\"url\":\"/rent/mont-kiara/condo\",\"primaryKeyword\":\"condo for rent in mont kiara\",\"secondaryKeywords\":[\"apartment for rent mont kiara\",\"flat for rent mont kiara\",\"condo for rent in mont kiara near mrt\"]},{\"type\":\"Studio\",\"url\":\"/rent/mont-kiara/studio\",\"primaryKeyword\":\"studio for rent in mont kiara\",\"secondaryKeywords\":[\"studio apartment for rent mont kiara\",\"studio for rent mont kiara furnished\",\"studio to let mont kiara near mrt\"]},{\"type\":\"Room\",\"url\":\"/rent/mont-kiara/room\",\"primaryKeyword\":\"room for rent in mont kiara\",\"secondaryKeywords\":[\"room to let in mont kiara\",\"master room for rent mont kiara\",\"cheap room for rent mont kiara\"]}],\"keywords\":{\"area\":\"Mont Kiara\",\"gscTier\":\"A\",\"gscClicks90d\":416.0,\"gscImpressions90d\":38296.0,\"source\":\"legacy_top60\",\"categories\":[{\"type\":\"House\",\"url\":\"https://speedhome.com/rent/mont-kiara\",\"primaryKeyword\":\"houses for rent in mont kiara\",\"secondaryKeywords\":[\"house to let in mont kiara\",\"property for rent in mont kiara\",\"home for rent in mont kiara\"]},{\"type\":\"Condo\",\"url\":\"https://speedhome.com/rent/mont-kiara/condo\",\"primaryKeyword\":\"condo for rent in mont kiara\",\"secondaryKeywords\":[\"apartment for rent mont kiara\",\"flat for rent mont kiara\",\"apartment for rent in mont kiara near lrt\"]},{\"type\":\"Studio\",\"url\":\"https://speedhome.com/rent/mont-kiara/studio\",\"primaryKeyword\":\"studio for rent in mont kiara\",\"secondaryKeywords\":[\"studio apartment for rent mont kiara\",\"studio for rent in mont kiara fully furnished\",\"studio to let in mont kiara near lrt\"]},{\"type\":\"Room\",\"url\":\"https://speedhome.com/rent/mont-kiara/room\",\"primaryKeyword\":\"room for rent in mont kiara\",\"secondaryKeywords\":[\"room to let in mont kiara\",\"master room for rent mont kiara\",\"cheap room for rent mont kiara\"]}]},\"jsonld\":{\"@context\":null,\"@graph\":null},\"_factPack\":{\"liveCount\":18,\"priceFloor\":385,\"priceCeiling