6X-Amz-Expires=3600\\u0026X-Amz-Credential=AKIAZIC2K7J72QHKGBZJ%2F20260608%2Fap-southeast-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request\\u0026X-Amz-Signature=c2bff3c8623cb7cfa74ba49e477495afd5207a79246d43607698b4389bb8a049\",\"status\":\"APPROVED\"},\"outOfCoverageArea\":false,\"slug\":\"savvy-riana-dutamas-2-lhvlldkz\",\"aiDescription\":null,\"isRented\":false,\"marketingStatus\":null,\"marketingStatusLabel\":null,\"tenantStatus\":null,\"chatRequestCount\":13,\"viewingAppointmentCount\":2,\"uniqueViewCount\":null},{\"id\":300029,\"user\":{\"id\":3267095,\"name\":\"Ammirul Akhmal Asyraf Bin Aman\",\"avatar\":null,\"avatarImageUrl\":null,\"phoneNumber\":null,\"userStatsDto\":null,\"isVerifiedLandlord\":null,\"isVerifiedUser\":false},\"ref\":\"STYQPRQO\",\"name\":\"Savio Riana Dutamas, Segambut\",\"address\":\"368, Jalan Segambut, Segambut, 51200 Kuala Lumpur, Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur\",\"level\":\"13\",\"storeys\":null,\"type\":\"HIGHRISE\",\"furnishType\":\"FULL\",\"roomType\":null,\"bathroomType\":null,\"status\":\"ACTIVE\",\"active\":true,\"instantView\":false,\"noDeposit\":true,\"fullyFurnishable\":false,\"negotiable\":true,\"owner\":true,\"sqft\":903,\"bedroom\":2,\"bathroom\":2,\"carpark\":0,\"roommate\":null,\"price\":2500,\"postcode\":\"51200\",\"unitNumber\":\"B-13-16\",\"latitude\":3.184999166508273,\"longitude\":101.66889166508793,\"description\":\"Modern Living at Savio @ Residensi Riana Dutamas\\r\\nLooking for a stylish, hassle-free home in a prime location? This unit at Savio, Riana Dutamas offers the perfect blend of comfort and convenience—just bring your luggage!\\r\\n\\r\\nUnit Highlights\\r\\n\\r\\nMonthly Rent: RM3,000\\r\\n\\r\\nFully Furnished (Move-in ready)\\r\\n2 Spacious Bedrooms \\u0026 2 Modern Bathrooms\\r\\nFully equipped with Air Conditioning in bedrooms.\\r\\nBoth bathrooms come with Water Heaters installed.\\r\\nFREE High-Speed WiFi included in the rent and warer dispenser (Coway) — save your money and skip the contract hassle!\\r\\n\\r\\nWhy Choose Savio @ Riana Dutamas?\\r\\n\\r\\nUnbeatable Accessibility\\r\\nLocated in the heart of North Kiara, you are minutes away from Mont Kiara, Publika, and Dutamas. With direct access to the DUKE Highway and Jalan Tuanku Abdul Halim, commuting to KL City Centre is a breeze.\\r\\n\\r\\nModern Facilities\\r\\nEnjoy resort-style living with a spectacular infinity pool, a fully equipped gymnasium, landscaped gardens, and a multi-purpose hall—all within a secured, 24-hour guarded community.\\r\\n\\r\\nVibrant Lifestyle \\u0026 Amenities\\r\\nYou are surrounded by premium grocery stores, trendy cafes, and international schools. Whether it’s a weekend brunch at Solaris Dutamas or shopping at 1 Mont Kiara, everything you need is just a short drive away.\\r\\n\\r\\nPublic Transport Link\\r\\nThe residence is strategically positioned near the Segambut KTM station, providing an alternative commute for those working in the CBD.\\r\\n\\r\\nEverything is ready for you.\\r\\nWhy worry about buying furniture or setting up internet? Move into this fully-equipped home today.\",\"allRaces\":true,\"petFriendly\":true,\"minRentalDuration\":12,\"editorPick\":false,\"furnishes\":[\"water_heater\",\"curtain\",\"mattress\",\"fridge\",\"wardrobe\",\"ac\",\"washing_machine\",\"tv\",\"bed_frame\",\"dining_table\",\"hood\",\"sofa\",\"kitchen_cabinet\",\"internet\"],\"utilityTypes\":[],\"facilities\":[\"mart\",\"dobby\",\"bbq\",\"sauna\",\"playground\",\"swimming\",\"gym\",\"covered_parking\",\"security24hr\",\"elevator\",\"basketball\"],\"images\":[{\"id\":1874662,\"propertyId\":300029,\"imageId\":1902351,\"code\":\"EWA0IHBSLQ1MYKUF\",\"coverPhoto\":true,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/EWA0IHBSLQ1MYKUF-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/EWA0IHBSLQ1MYKUF-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern 2-bedroom apartment with a balcony in Segambut, Kuala Lumpur, fully furnished and ready to move in.\"},{\"id\":1874656,\"propertyId\":300029,\"imageId\":1902345,\"code\":\"HLOTDHQWGOPDQ8EY\",\"coverPhoto\":false,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/HLOTDHQWGOPDQ8EY-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/HLOTDHQWGOPDQ8EY-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern 2-bedroom apartment with a balcony, fully furnished in Segambut, Kuala Lumpur.\"},{\"id\":1874657,\"propertyId\":300029,\"imageId\":1902346,\"code\":\"EOQNDPRFSPFVNJNI\",\"coverPhoto\":false,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/EOQNDPRFSPFVNJNI-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/EOQNDPRFSPFVNJNI-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern 2-bedroom apartment with a bright living area and city views in Segambut, Kuala Lumpur.\"},{\"id\":1874658,\"propertyId\":300029,\"imageId\":1902347,\"code\":\"2ICTWNXWOYG08HWV\",\"coverPhoto\":false,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/2ICTWNXWOYG08HWV-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/2ICTWNXWOYG08HWV-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern 2-bedroom apartment with a fully equipped kitchen and city views in Segambut, Kuala Lumpur.\"},{\"id\":1874659,\"propertyId\":300029,\"imageId\":1902348,\"code\":\"IC6PV85AUL2LHGJJ\",\"coverPhoto\":false,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/IC6PV85AUL2LHGJJ-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/STYQPRQO/IC6PV85AUL2LHGJJ-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern 2-bedroom apartment with a fully equipped kitchen in Segambut, Kuala Lumpur.\"},{\"id\":1874660,\"propertyId\":300029,\"imageId