,\"isVerifiedLandlord\":null,\"isVerifiedUser\":false},\"ref\":\"GALEJFHG\",\"name\":\"Villa Putra Condominium, Kuala Lumpur\",\"address\":\"33, Jalan Tun Ismail, Chow Kit, 50480 Kuala Lumpur\",\"level\":\"6\",\"storeys\":null,\"type\":\"ROOM\",\"furnishType\":\"FULL\",\"roomType\":\"MASTER\",\"bathroomType\":\"PRIVATE\",\"status\":\"ACTIVE\",\"active\":true,\"instantView\":false,\"noDeposit\":true,\"fullyFurnishable\":false,\"negotiable\":true,\"owner\":true,\"sqft\":280,\"bedroom\":1,\"bathroom\":1,\"carpark\":0,\"roommate\":1,\"price\":1050,\"postcode\":\"50480\",\"unitNumber\":\"A\",\"latitude\":3.165463,\"longitude\":101.692908,\"description\":\"Room in VILLA PUTRA CODOMINIUM with private bathroom for 1 person (NO PARTITION ROOM )\\n\\nVilla Putra Condo @ PWTC LRT,KTM PUTRA, NEXT STAION MRT \\u0026 MONORAIL TITIWANGSA \\n\\n(Next to Sunway Putra Mall, near UMNO, Hospital KL, and Kampung Baru)\\n\\n✨ No partition | Quiet unit with only 3 rooms\\n✨ Newly renovated | Bright corner unit with balcony\\n✨ Full condo facilities: Pool, Gym, BBQ area\\n\\n🛏 Available Rooms\\n✅ AC Queen Room (Priate Bathroom)\\n\\n\\n🚆 Superb Connectivity\\n👣 3 min walk to Sunway Putra Mall\\n👣 5 min walk to LRT PWTC\\n👣 3 min walk to KTM Putra\\n👣 10 min LRT interchange MRT Titiwangsa\\n\\n🚗 Driving Distance to Key Destinations\\n▪ 6 min to KLCC\\n▪ 7 min to KL Sentral\\n▪ 7 min to Hospital KL\\n▪ 9 min to Pavilion\\n▪10 min to Mid Valley\\n▪11 min to TRX\\n\\n🏡 Unit Highlights\\n✔ Quiet corner unit – spacious \\u0026 peaceful\\n✔ No partitions – true private space\\n✔ Cooking allowed | Non-smoking | Water filter provided\\n✔ Individual fridge \\u0026 pantry space for each tenant\\n\\n🪑 Room Furnishings\\n▪ Air-conditioner + Fan + Window Ventilation\\n▪ Queen-size Bed\\n▪ Wardrobe + Study Desk \\u0026 Chair\\n▪ Dual warm/cool lighting + Track Lights + Curtains\\n- Smart Door Lock\\n\\n➤ Book a viewing \\u0026 request more photos\\n➤ Secure a quality room early – first come,\\u0026nbsp;f