 access.\\n\\nPremium Kitchen \\u0026 Home Appliances Included:\\n- Modern Kitchen Hood \\u0026 Hob\\n- Multi-Functional Kitchen Sink (perfect for home cooks)\\n- Large 280L Refrigerator\\n- Effortless Laundry: 8kg Top-Load Washing Machine \\u0026 Dedicated Dryer\\n\\nUnmatched Accessibility \\u0026 Location\\n- Nestled in a strategic transit hub with direct connections to major highways (Jalan Kuching, Jalan Tun Razak, and the DUKE Highway), putting the entire city within easy reach.\\n- Commute: Just a 10-minute drive to the heart of KL City Centre (KLCC).\\n- Public Transport: 3-minute drive / short distance to Putra KTM Station (and nearby LRT connections).\\n- Shopping \\u0026 Groceries: 3-minute drive to Cold Storage at Sunway Putra Mall for all your premium grocery, dining, and retail needs.\",\"allRaces\":true,\"petFriendly\":false,\"minRentalDuration\":12,\"editorPick\":true,\"furnishes\":[\"hood\",\"kitchen_cabinet\",\"water_heater\",\"fridge\",\"curtain\",\"washing_machine\",\"ac\"],\"utilityTypes\":[\"WATER\",\"ELECTRICITY\"],\"facilities\":[\"covered_parking\",\"gym\",\"playground\",\"bbq\",\"sauna\",\"swimming\",\"security24hr\"],\"images\":[{\"id\":1763041,\"propertyId\":288415,\"imageId\":1789391,\"code\":\"F8YHBDNGD1DAFZN7\",\"coverPhoto\":true,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/JMWYNSAR/F8YHBDNGD1DAFZN7-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/JMWYNSAR/F8YHBDNGD1DAFZN7-medium.jpg\",\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"label\":\"\",\"altText\":\"Modern kitchen with hood \\u0026 hob in a 2-bedroom unit at Duta Park Residences, Kuala Lumpur.\"},{\"id\":1763037,\"propertyId\":288415,\"imageId\":1789387,\"code\":\"RPPWPNS0M2WVH4IO\",\"coverPhoto\":false,\"url\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/JMWYNSAR/RPPWPNS0M2WVH4IO-medium.jpg\",\"imageUrl\":\"https://image.speedhome.com/speedrent-backend/images/property/JMWYNSAR/RPPWPNS0M2WVH4IO-medium.jpg\",\"type\