s have private parking spaces or garages.\",\"kajang_ques_4\":\"Are utilities included in the rent?\",\"kajang_ans_4\":\"No, tenants must pay for electricity, water, and internet separately.\",\"kajang_ques_5\":\"Are pet-friendly houses available in Kajang?\",\"kajang_ans_5\":\"Some houses allow pets, but it’s best to check with the landlord.\",\"kajang_ques_6\":\"How safe is renting a house in Kajang?\",\"kajang_ans_6\":\"Many areas in Kajang are gated and have 24-hour security for added safety.\",\"kajang_ques_7\":\"Are short-term rental houses available in Kajang?\",\"kajang_ans_7\":\"Some landlords allow short-term leases, but 12-month leases are standard.\",\"kajang_ques_8\":\"Do houses in Kajang have gardens?\",\"kajang_ans_8\":\"Many houses feature gardens, backyards, or outdoor patios.\",\"kajang_ques_9\":\"Are houses near public transport in Kajang?\",\"kajang_ans_9\":\"Some houses are close to MRT, KTM stations, and highways.\",\"kajang_ques_10\":\"How do I rent a house in Kajang?\",\"kajang_ans_10\":\"Browse listings, schedule a viewing, and apply through SPEEDHOME.\",\"kajang_house_ques_1\":\"What is the average rental price for houses in Kajang?\",\"kajang_house_ans_1\":\"House rentals in Kajang typically range from RM1,800 to RM5,500 per month, depending on location and size.\",\"kajang_house_ques_2\":\"Are houses in Kajang fully furnished?\",\"kajang_house_ans_2\":\"Some houses are fully furnished, while others are semi-furnished or unfurnished, depending on the listing.\",\"kajang_house_ques_3\":\"Do houses in Kajang include parking?\",\"kajang_house_ans_3\":\"Yes, most houses offer private parking spaces, with some having covered garages or car porches.\",\"kajang_house_ques_4\":\"Are utilities included in the rent?\",\"kajang_house_ans_4\":\"No, water, electricity, and internet are usually not included and are paid separately by the tenant.\",\"kajang_house_ques_5\":\"Are pet-friendly houses available in Kajang?\",\"kajang_house_ans_5\":\"Yes, some houses allow pets, but it’s best to check with the landlord for specific pet policies.\",\"kajang_house_ques_6\":\"Is Kajang a good area to rent a house?\",\"kajang_house_ans_6\":\"Yes, Kajang is a developing residential area with good schools, universities, and easy access to highways and public transport.\",\"kajang_house_ques_7\":\"How secure are houses for rent in Kajang?\",\"kajang_house_ans_7\":\"Many homes are in gated and guarded communities, and some have CCTV and security systems for extra safety.\",\"kajang_house_ques_8\":\"Are short-term rental houses available in Kajang?\",\"kajang_house_ans_8\":\"Most landlords prefer 12-month leases, but some may offer short-term rentals upon request.\",\"kajang_house_ques_9\":\"Do houses in Kajang have gardens or outdoor spaces?\",\"kajang_house_ans_9\":\"Many houses have gardens, yards, or patios, which are ideal for families and outdoor activities.\",\"kajang_house_ques_10\":\"How do I rent a house in Kajang?\",\"kajang_house_ans_10\":\"Browse listings on SPEEDHOME, schedule a viewing, and apply online for a smooth rental process.\",\"kajang_studio_ques_1\":\"How much does a studio cost in Kajang?\",\"kajang_studio_ans_1\":\"Studio rentals range from RM900 to RM1,800 per month, depending on size and location.\",\"kajang_studio_ques_2\":\"Are studios in Kajang furnished?\",\"kajang_studio_ans_2\":\"Most studios are fully furnished, including a bed, wardrobe, kitchenette, and air conditioning.\",\"kajang_studio_ques_3\":\"Do studios in Kajang include Wi-Fi?\",\"kajang_studio_ans_3\":\"Wi-Fi is not usually included in the rent, and tenants need to arrange their own internet services.\",\"kajang_studio_ques_4\":\"Are short-term studio rentals available in Kajang?\",\"kajang_studio_ans_4\":\"Some landlords offer short-term leases, but 12-month contracts are more common.\",\"kajang_studio_ques_5\":\"Is parking available for studio apartments in Kajang?\",\"kajang_studio_ans_5\":\"Some buildings offer parking spaces, but