ays?\",\"oldklangroad_room_ans_3\":\"Yes, many landlords offer rooms for short-term rentals, particularly through platforms like SPEEDHOME.\",\"oldklangroad_room_ques_4\":\"Are utilities included in the room rental price?\",\"oldklangroad_room_ans_4\":\"Utility costs are often separate from the rent; however, some landlords may include them in the monthly fee.\",\"oldklangroad_room_ques_5\":\"Is it easy to find a shared room rental on Old Klang Road?\",\"oldklangroad_room_ans_5\":\"Yes, shared room rentals are common and provide a more budget-friendly option for individuals.\",\"oldklangroad_room_ques_6\":\"Do rooms for rent on Old Klang Road allow for customization or decoration?\",\"oldklangroad_room_ans_6\":\"Customization policies vary by landlord; it’s recommended to discuss any changes before moving in.\",\"oldklangroad_room_ques_7\":\"Is there public transport accessibility near room rentals on Old Klang Road?\",\"oldklangroad_room_ans_7\":\"Yes, many rooms for rent are located near bus stops or LRT stations, making commuting easy.\",\"oldklangroad_room_ques_8\":\"Are there any specific rental policies for rooms on Old Klang Road?\",\"oldklangroad_room_ans_8\":\"Policies may vary; it's best to inquire directly with the landlord regarding terms like deposit, duration, and guests.\",\"oldklangroad_room_ques_9\":\"Can I find room rentals near schools or universities on Old Klang Road?\",\"oldklangroad_room_ans_9\":\"Yes, there are several room rentals located near educational institutions, making it ideal for students.\",\"oldklangroad_room_ques_10\":\"How do I book a room rental on Old Klang Road?\",\"oldklangroad_room_ans_10\":\"You can book a room through rental websites or by contacting the landlord directly for an arrangement.\",\"oldklangroad_house_ques_1\":\"What is the average rental price for a house on Old Klang Road?\",\"oldklangroad_house_ans_1\":\"Houses on Old Klang Road generally rent for between RM 3,000 and RM 7,000 per month, depending on size 