erty; some rooms may have rules regarding guests, smoking, and pets.\",\"sentul_room_ques_8\":\"Do room rentals in Sentul come with internet access?\",\"sentul_room_ans_8\":\"Many rooms include high-speed internet access, but it’s important to confirm the details with the property owner.\",\"sentul_room_ques_9\":\"What is the application process for renting a room in Sentul?\",\"sentul_room_ans_9\":\"Typically, you need to submit a rental application and provide identification and rental references.\",\"sentul_room_ques_10\":\"Are room rentals in Sentul suitable for students?\",\"sentul_room_ans_10\":\"Yes, Sentul offers many room rentals that cater to students, particularly those looking for affordable, convenient accommodations.\",\"sentul_house_ques_1\":\"What types of houses can I rent in Sentul?\",\"sentul_house_ans_1\":\"You can rent a variety of houses in Sentul, including semi-detached houses, terraced houses, and bungalows.\",\"sentul_house_ques_2\":\"How much does it cost to rent a house in Sentul?\",\"sentul_house_ans_2\":\"House rental prices in Sentul vary, but typically range from RM 2,500 to RM 8,000 per month, depending on size and location.\",\"sentul_house_ques_3\":\"Do houses in Sentul come with private parking spaces?\",\"sentul_house_ans_3\":\"Yes, most houses offer dedicated parking spaces or garages for residents.\",\"sentul_house_ques_4\":\"Are there family-friendly houses for rent in Sentul?\",\"sentul_house_ans_4\":\"Many houses in Sentul cater to families, offering multiple bedrooms, gardens, and access to local schools and parks.\",\"sentul_house_ques_5\":\"Can I find furnished houses for rent in Sentul?\",\"sentul_house_ans_5\":\"Yes, furnished houses are available, though it’s recommended to check the listing for specific furniture and amenities.\",\"sentul_house_ques_6\":\"What is the lease term for houses in Sentul?\",\"sentul_house_ans_6\":\"Lease terms for houses generally range from one year to two years, with options for renewal.\