atforms like SPEEDHOME offer zero-deposit rental options.\",\"kualalumpur_ques_7\":\"Are pets allowed in rental properties in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_ans_7\":\"Some properties are pet-friendly; always check with the landlord first.\",\"kualalumpur_ques_8\":\"How do I find affordable rental homes in Kuala Lumpur?\",\"kualalumpur_ans_8\":\"Comparing listings and negotiating with landlords can help secure better deals.\",\"kualalumpur_ques_9\":\"Is public transport easily accessible from rental homes?\",\"kualalumpur_ans_9\":\"Yes, most properties are near MRT, LRT, Monorail, or bus stations.\",\"kualalumpur_ques_10\":\"What documents are required to rent a home in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_ans_10\":\"Commonly required documents include ID/passport, proof of income, and tenancy agreements.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_1\":\"What are the advantages of renting an apartment in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_1\":\"Apartments offer modern amenities, security, and proximity to city hotspots.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_2\":\"What is the rental price range for apartments in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_2\":\"Prices start from RM 1,200 for basic units and go up to RM 5,000 for luxury apartments.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_3\":\"Are short-term apartment rentals available in Kuala Lumpur?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_3\":\"Yes, some apartments allow short-term leases, but most require a one-year commitment.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_4\":\"Do Kuala Lumpur apartments come with parking?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_4\":\"Most apartments offer at least one parking spot per unit.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_5\":\"Are utilities included in apartment rent?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_5\":\"Usually, tenants pay separately for electricity, water, and internet.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_6\":\"Do apartments in KL have shared facilities?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_6\":\"Yes, many apartments provide swimming pools, gyms, and security services.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_7\":\"How do I find an apartment near my workplace in Kuala Lumpur?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_7\":\"Use online rental platforms with location filters to find convenient options.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_8\":\"Are there pet-friendly apartments in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_8\":\"Some apartments allow pets, but always check the building’s regulations.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_9\":\"Is a deposit required when renting an apartment in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_9\":\"Typically, a security deposit is required, but some platforms offer zero deposit options.\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ques_10\":\"Can foreigners rent apartments in Kuala Lumpur?\",\"kualalumpur_apartment_ans_10\":\"Yes, expats can rent apartments with proper documentation.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_1\":\"What is the average price of a studio apartment in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_1\":\"Prices range from RM 1,200 to RM 3,500, depending on location and amenities.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_2\":\"Who should consider renting a studio apartment?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_2\":\"Ideal for students, young professionals, and expats looking for compact living.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_3\":\"Do studio apartments in KL come fully furnished?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_3\":\"Many studios offer furnished options with beds, kitchenettes, and appliances.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_4\":\"Are utilities included in studio rentals?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_4\":\"Usually, utilities are billed separately unless stated otherwise.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_5\":\"What are the best areas for studio rentals in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_5\":\"KLCC, Bukit Bintang, and Mont Kiara are popular for studio apartments.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_6\":\"Do studio apartments have private bathrooms?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_6\":\"Yes, all studio apartments have private en-suite bathrooms.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_7\":\"Is public transport easily accessible from studio apartments?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_7\":\"Most studios are near MRT and LRT stations for easy commuting.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_8\":\"Are there pet-friendly studio apartments in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_8\":\"Some allow pets but always confirm with the landlord.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_9\":\"How do I find a cheap studio apartment in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_9\":\"Compare listings, check promotions, and consider renting in suburban areas.\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ques_10\":\"Can couples rent a studio apartment in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_studio_ans_10\":\"Yes, studio apartments are suitable for single occupants or couples.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_1\":\"What is the average rental price for condos in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_1\":\"Prices range from RM 2,500 to RM 10,000, depending on size and location.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_2\":\"Are condos in KL fully furnished?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_2\":\"Many come furnished with modern appliances and furniture.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_3\":\"Do condos have security services?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_3\":\"Yes, most condos offer 24/7 security, CCTV, and gated access.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_4\":\"Are pets allowed in Kuala Lumpur condos?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_4\":\"Some condos allow pets but always check building regulations.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_5\":\"Can foreigners rent condos in Kuala Lumpur?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_5\":\"Yes, expats can rent condos with the proper tenancy agreement.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_6\":\"Do condo rentals include parking spaces?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_6\":\"Most condos offer at least one parking lot per unit.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_7\":\"Is maintenance included in condo rent?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_7\":\"Landlords usually cover maintenance but confirm before renting.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_8\":\"Which areas have the best condo rentals in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_8\":\"KLCC, Mont Kiara, and Bangsar are premium condo locations.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_9\":\"Are there fully serviced condos available in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_9\":\"Yes, serviced condos offer hotel-like amenities and concierge services.\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ques_10\":\"Can I negotiate rent for a condo in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_condo_ans_10\":\"Yes, landlords may offer discounts for long-term leases.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_1\":\"What is the average rent for a room in Kuala Lumpur?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_1\":\"Room rentals range from RM 500 to RM 1,800, depending on location and amenities.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_2\":\"Are utility bills included in room rentals?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_2\":\"Some include utilities, while others require separate payments for electricity, water, and internet.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_3\":\"Can I rent a room in KL without a deposit?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_3\":\"Yes, platforms like SPEEDHOME offer zero-deposit rental options.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_4\":\"What areas in KL offer budget-friendly room rentals?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_4\":\"Suburbs like Cheras, Wangsa Maju, and Setapak have affordable options.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_5\":\"Do rented rooms come furnished?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_5\":\"Most rooms include basic furniture like a bed, desk, and wardrobe.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_6\":\"Is there a minimum lease period for room rentals?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_6\":\"Standard leases are for 6-12 months, but short-term rentals are available.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_7\":\"Are there female-only room rentals in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_7\":\"Yes, some landlords offer rooms exclusively for female tenants.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_8\":\"Can I share a rented room with a friend?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_8\":\"Some landlords allow shared occupancy, but it depends on the rental agreement.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_9\":\"Is public transport easily accessible from rental rooms?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_9\":\"Many rental rooms are near MRT, LRT, and bus stations for convenience.\",\"kualalumpur_room_ques_10\":\"Are room rentals in KL safe?\",\"kualalumpur_room_ans_10\":\"Always choose rentals with secure access, CCTV, and reputable landlords.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_1\":\"What is the average rental price for houses in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_1\":\"Prices start from RM 2,500 for smaller homes and go up to RM 15,000 for luxury villas.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_2\":\"Which areas in KL are best for renting a house?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_2\":\"Mont Kiara, Bangsar, and Desa Park City are popular among families and expats.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_3\":\"Are houses in KL pet-friendly?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_3\":\"Many landed properties allow pets, but always confirm with the landlord.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_4\":\"Do house rentals include maintenance services?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_4\":\"Some landlords cover maintenance, while others require tenants to handle it.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_5\":\"Are there gated community houses available in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_5\":\"Yes, areas like Desa Park City and Damansara Heights offer gated communities with security.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_6\":\"Do house rentals come with parking spaces?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_6\":\"Most houses provide at least one or two private parking spots.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_7\":\"Can I negotiate the rent for a house in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_7\":\"Yes, landlords may offer discounts for long-term leases or upfront payments.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_8\":\"Are furnished houses available for rent in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_8\":\"Both furnished and unfurnished options are available, depending on the listing.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_9\":\"Do houses for rent in KL have a backyard or garden?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_9\":\"Some landed homes feature private gardens or outdoor spaces.\",\"kualalumpur_house_ques_10\":\"Is it easy to find family-friendly house rentals in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_house_ans_10\":\"Yes, many neighborhoods cater to families with parks, schools, and amenities nearby.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_1\":\"What is the rental price range for terrace houses in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_1\":\"Prices start from RM 2,000 for basic units and go up to RM 6,000 for larger homes.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_2\":\"Are terrace houses in Kuala Lumpur suitable for families?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_2\":\"Yes, they offer ample space and are ideal for families with children.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_3\":\"Which areas in KL have the best terrace houses for rent?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_3\":\"Desa Park City, Taman Tun Dr. Ismail (TTDI), and Bangsar are top choices.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_4\":\"Do terrace houses come with parking spaces?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_4\":\"Yes, most provide one or two private parking spots.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_5\":\"Are utilities included in terrace house rentals?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_5\":\"Tenants usually pay for utilities separately.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_6\":\"Do terrace houses in KL have gated security?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_6\":\"Some are in gated communities, while others are in open residential areas.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_7\":\"Are there pet-friendly terrace houses in KL?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_7\":\"Yes, many landlords allow pets, especially in landed properties.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_8\":\"Can I rent a terrace house for short-term stays?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_8\":\"Most require a one-year lease, but some landlords offer short-term rentals.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_9\":\"Do terrace houses come with a backyard or garden?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_9\":\"Some units have small gardens or outdoor spaces.\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ques_10\":\"Is public transport easily accessible from terrace house rentals?\",\"kualalumpur_terrace_ans_10\":\"Many are near MRT and LRT stations, providing easy access to the city.\",\"damansara_ques_1\":\"What types of rental properties are available in Damansara?\",\"damansara_ans_1\":\"Damansara offers a variety of rental options, including apartments, condominiums, terrace houses, and studio units.\",\"damansara_ques_2\":\"Are there pet-friendly rental properties in Damansara?\",\"damansara_ans_2\":\"Yes, several landlords in Damansara accommodate tenants with pets; it's advisable to confirm pet policies before renting.\",\"damansara_ques_3\":\"What is the average rental price for a two-bedroom apartment in Damansara?\",\"damansara_ans_3\":\"Rental prices vary based on location and amenities, but on average, a two-bedroom apartment rents for around RM 4,000.\",\"damansara_ques_4\":\"How can I find zero-deposit rental properties in Damansara?\",\"damansara_ans_4\":\"Platforms like SPEEDHOME offer zero-deposit rental options in Damansara.\",\"damansara_ques_5\":\"Are furnished rental units available in Damansara?\",\"damansara_ans_5\":\"Yes, many properties come fully or partially furnished, catering to different tenant preferences.\",\"damansara_ques_6\":\"Is Damansara a suitable area for expatriates seeking rental homes?\",\"damansara_ans_6\":\"Damansara is popular among expatriates due to its upscale housing and proximity to international schools.\",\"damansara_ques_7\":\"What public transportation options are accessible from Damansara rental properties?\",\"damansara_ans_7\":\"Damansara is well-connected via MRT and LRT stations, facilitating easy commutes.\",\"damansara_ques_8\":\"Can I find short-term rental options in Damansara?\",\"damansara_ans_8\":\"Yes, short-term rentals are available, especially through platforms like Airbnb.\",\"damansara_ques_9\":\"What amenities are commonly included in Damansara rental properties?\",\"damansara_ans_9\":\"Common amenities include swimming pools, gyms, and 24-hour security services.\",\"damansara_ques_10\":\"How do I schedule a virtual viewing for a rental property in Damansara?\",\"damansara_ans_10\":\"Many rental platforms offer virtual tours; you can request one through the property listing or contact the landlord directly.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_1\":\"What is the typical size of a studio apartment in Damansara?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_1\":\"Studio apartments typically range from 500 to 700 square feet.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_2\":\"Are utilities included in the rent for studio apartments?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_2\":\"This varies by property; some rentals include utilities, while others require separate payments.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_3\":\"Do studio apartments in Damansara come with kitchen facilities?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_3\":\"Yes, most studio units are equipped with basic kitchen amenities.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_4\":\"Is parking available for studio apartment tenants?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_4\":\"Many buildings offer parking facilities, but it's essential to confirm availability and any associated fees.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_5\":\"Are there any serviced studio apartments in Damansara?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_5\":\"Yes, serviced studios with additional amenities like housekeeping are available.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_6\":\"What is the average rental cost for a studio apartment in Damansara?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_6\":\"On average, studio apartments rent for approximately RM 2,300.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_7\":\"Can I find fully furnished studio apartments in Damansara?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_7\":\"Yes, there are fully furnished options available, ideal for tenants seeking move-in-ready units.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_8\":\"Are studio apartments in Damansara suitable for single professionals?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_8\":\"They offer a compact and efficient living space perfect for single occupants.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_9\":\"Do studio apartments allow for customization or redecorating?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_9\":\"Policies vary; it's best to discuss customization options with the landlord.\",\"damansara_studio_ques_10\":\"How do I apply for a studio apartment rental in Damansara?\",\"damansara_studio_ans_10\":\"You can apply through rental platforms or directly contact property agents to begin the application process.\",\"damansara_apartment_ques_1\":\"What are the benefits of renting an apartment in Damansara?\",\"damansara_apartment_ans_1\":\"Benefits include modern facilities, strategic location, and access to shopping centers and eateries.\",\"damansara_apartment_ques_2\":\"Are there pet-friendly apartments in Damansara?\",\"damansara_apartment_ans_2\":\"Yes, some apartments allow pets; it's important to verify each property's pet policy.\",\"damansara_apartment_ques_3\":\"What is the average rental price for a three-bedroom apartment in Damansara?\",\"damansara_apartment_ans_3\":\"The average rent for a three-bedroom apartment is around RM 5,400.\",\"damansara_apartment_ques_4\":\"Do apartments in Damansara come with recreational facilities like gyms and pools?\",\"damansara_apartment_ans_4\":\"Many apartment complexes offer amenities such as swimming pools, fitness centers, and playgrounds.\",\"damansara_apartment_ques_5\":\"Is 24-hour security standard in Damansara apartments?\",\"damansara_apartment_ans_5\":\"Yes, most apartments provide round-the-clock security services for residents' safety.\",\"damansara_apartment_ques_6\":\"Are there apartments suitable for families in Damansara?\",\"damansara_apartment_ans_6\":\"Certainly, numerous family-friendly apartments offer multiple bedrooms and are located near schools and parks.\",\"damansara_apartment_ques_7\":\"Can I find apartments with easy access to public transportation in Damansara?\",\"damansara_apartment_ans_7\":\"Yes, many apartments are situated close to MRT and LRT stations, enhancing commuting convenience.\",\"damansara_apartment_ques_8\":\"What is the process for renting an apartment in Damansara?\",\"damansara_apartment_ans_8\":\"The process typically involves property viewing, submitting an application, and signing a tenancy agreement.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_1\":\"What are the benefits of renting a condo in Damansara?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_1\":\"Condos offer premium facilities like swimming pools, gyms, and security.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_2\":\"What is the average rental price for a condo in Damansara?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_2\":\"Rental prices range from RM 3,500 to RM 8,000, depending on location and size.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_3\":\"Are condos in Damansara fully furnished?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_3\":\"Some condos come fully furnished, while others may offer semi-furnished or unfurnished options.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_4\":\"Do condos in Damansara have high security?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_4\":\"Yes, most condos have gated entry, security guards, and surveillance systems.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_5\":\"Are there pet-friendly condos in Damansara?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_5\":\"Some condos allow pets, but it's essential to check the building’s policies.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_6\":\"Can I rent a condo with short-term leasing options?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_6\":\"Some landlords offer short-term leases, but most prefer long-term tenants.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_7\":\"Do condos in Damansara offer parking spaces?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_7\":\"Yes, most condos provide allocated parking spaces for residents.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_8\":\"Is maintenance included in the rental price of a condo?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_8\":\"Maintenance fees are typically covered by the landlord unless stated otherwise.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_9\":\"Are there condos available near MRT stations in Damansara?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_9\":\"Yes, many condos are within walking distance of MRT stations.\",\"damansara_condo_ques_10\":\"How do I find the best condo rental deals in Damansara?\",\"damansara_condo_ans_10\":\"Using platforms like SPEEDHOME helps you find condos with competitive pricing and no deposit options.\",\"damansara_room_ques_1\":\"What is the average price of a room rental in Damansara?\",\"damansara_room_ans_1\":\"Prices vary from RM 500 to RM 2,500, depending on location and amenities.\",\"damansara_room_ques_2\":\"Are utilities included in room rentals?\",\"damansara_room_ans_2\":\"Some room rentals include utilities, while others require tenants to split costs.\",\"damansara_room_ques_3\":\"Can I find fully furnished room rentals in Damansara?\",\"damansara_room_ans_3\":\"Yes, most rooms come with basic furnishings like beds, wardrobes, and desks.\",\"damansara_room_ques_4\":\"Are there co-living spaces available in Damansara?\",\"damansara_room_ans_4\":\"Yes, many co-living options provide shared kitchens and common areas.\",\"damansara_room_ques_5\":\"Do room rentals in Damansara come with attached bathrooms?\",\"damansara_room_ans_5\":\"Some rooms have en-suite bathrooms, while others have shared facilities.\",\"damansara_room_ques_6\":\"Is there a security deposit required for renting a room?\",\"damansara_room_ans_6\":\"Some landlords require a deposit, but SPEEDHOME offers zero deposit options.\",\"damansara_room_ques_7\":\"Are there female-only room rentals in Damansara?\",\"damansara_room_ans_7\":\"Yes, there are exclusive listings for female tenants.\",\"damansara_room_ques_8\":\"How do I find a room rental near my workplace or university?\",\"damansara_room_ans_8\":\"Filtering searches by location on rental platforms can help.\",\"damansara_room_ques_9\":\"Can I rent a room for a short-term stay in Damansara?\",\"damansara_room_ans_9\":\"Yes, some landlords offer short-term leases for students and travelers.\",\"damansara_room_ques_10\":\"Are visitors allowed in rented rooms?\",\"damansara_room_ans_10\":\"This depends on the landlord's policy and house rules.\",\"damansara_house_ques_1\":\"What types of houses are available for rent in Damansara?\",\"damansara_house_ans_1\":\"Options include terrace houses, semi-detached homes, and bungalows.\",\"damansara_house_ques_2\":\"What is the average rent for a house in Damansara?\",\"damansara_house_ans_2\":\"Rental prices typically range from RM 5,000 to RM 15,000.\",\"damansara_house_ques_3\":\"Are furnished houses available for rent in Damansara?\",\"damansara_house_ans_3\":\"Yes, both furnished and unfurnished houses are available.\",\"damansara_house_ques_4\":\"Do houses for rent come with private gardens or backyards?\",\"damansara_house_ans_4\":\"Many houses feature outdoor spaces, making them great for families.\",\"damansara_house_ques_5\":\"Is Damansara a good place for family living?\",\"damansara_house_ans_5\":\"Yes, the area has parks, schools, and a safe environment for families.\",\"damansara_house_ques_6\":\"Do rental houses include parking for multiple cars?\",\"damansara_house_ans_6\":\"Most houses offer ample parking space, often for two or more vehicles.\",\"damansara_house_ques_7\":\"Can I rent a house with a swimming pool in Damansara?\",\"damansara_house_ans_7\":\"Luxury houses may include private pools; filtering searches can help find them.\",\"damansara_house_ques_8\":\"Are there pet-friendly houses for rent in Damansara?\",\"damansara_house_ans_8\":\"Yes, some landlords allow pets; confirming beforehand is advisable.\",\"damansara_house_ques_9\":\"What public transport options are available near rental houses?\",\"damansara_house_ans_9\":\"Buses and MRT stations make commuting convenient from most areas.\",\"damansara_house_ques_10\":\"How do I negotiate the best rental price for a house?\",\"damansara_house_ans_10\":\"Researching market rates and negotiating lease terms can help secure a better deal.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_1\":\"What are the benefits of renting a terrace house in Damansara?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_1\":\"Terrace houses provide spacious living areas, privacy, and affordability.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_2\":\"What is the average rental price for a terrace house in Damansara?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_2\":\"Rentals start from RM 4,000 and can go up to RM 10,000, depending on size and location.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_3\":\"Are terrace houses in Damansara gated and secured?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_3\":\"Some are in gated communities with added security.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_4\":\"Do terrace houses come with gardens or outdoor spaces?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_4\":\"Yes, many units have small gardens or patio areas.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_5\":\"Are there double-storey terrace houses available for rent?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_5\":\"Yes, both single and double-story terrace homes are available.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_6\":\"Do terrace houses in Damansara have car porches?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_6\":\"Most terrace houses come with covered parking spaces for two cars or more.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_7\":\"Can I renovate or modify a rented terrace house?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_7\":\"Landlord approval is required for major modifications.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_8\":\"Are terrace houses in Damansara pet-friendly?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_8\":\"Some landlords allow pets; checking individual listings is recommended.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_9\":\"Is public transport accessible from terrace house locations?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_9\":\"Many areas have easy access to MRT, LRT, and bus routes.\",\"damansara_terrace_ques_10\":\"How do I apply for a terrace house rental in Damansara?\",\"damansara_terrace_ans_10\":\"Online platforms like SPEEDHOME allow easy property viewing and application.\"}}},\"__N_SSP\":true},\"page\":\"/rent/[loc]\",\"query\":{\"loc\":\"mont-kiara\"},\"buildId\":\"build-1780918065278\",\"isFallback\":false,\"isExperimentalCompile\":false,\"dynamicIds\":[70928,41951],\"gssp\":true,\"locale\":\"en\",\"locales\":[\"en\",\"my\",\"zh\"],\"defaultLocale\":\"en\",\"scriptLoader\":[]}</script><div id=\"date-picker-portal\"></div><script defer src=\"https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v833ccba57c9e4d2798f2e76cebdd09a11778172276447\" integrity=\"sha512-57MDmcccJXYtNnH+ZiBwzC4jb2rvgVCEokYN+L/nLlmO8rfYT/gIpW2A569iJ/3b+0UEasghjuZH/ma3wIs/EQ==\" data-cf-beacon=